COMPILATION OF: E46M3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M3

   1 a 0000 E46M3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE MVI A OPERAND PER ITEM: three literals of THREE
   4 a 0006      DIFFERENT lengths on both routes. If DR passed the list's item
   5 a 0006      COUNT, or one width for all items, these operands say so. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   7 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M3OUT DAT');
   8 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A','BB','CCC');
   9 c 0053   put list('A','BB','CCC');
  10 c 0080   close file(outf);
  11 a 0086 end E46M3;

CODE SIZE = 0089
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 386B
END  COMPILATION
